WEBVTT

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:01.470
Let's do it!

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:03.640
You can't miss it!

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:04.440
Take this!

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:06.310
This winter...

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:08.610
Emperor Penguin No. 3!

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:11.320
An even more incredible penguin is coming!

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.110
Don't underestimate me!

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:17.200
FUNKY PENGUIN BABY!!

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:18.690
Happy dancing!

00:00:18.690 --> 00:00:20.080
Happy singing!

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:22.900
Happy Feet Two the movie!

00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:26.450
I can't stay silent after hearing about penguins.

00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:27.960
We'll just have to go see it.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.920
In theaters soon!

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:33.770
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:36.970
Not yet!

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.170
This... is my Avatar!

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:47.470
Abounding Snowfall Saya!

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:50.100
Yukimura has an Avatar?!

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:56.440
Viva! The Great Wall Of China!

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:02.070
Take this!

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.180
Icicle Road!

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:10.970
It's an Avatar's hissatsu shoot!

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:13.700
It's in!

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:16.130
Hakuren scores another goal!

00:01:16.810 --> 00:01:17.380
How's that?

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:19.730
I see.

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:24.980
Fifth Sector ousted me out because they wanted this power from Yukimura...

00:03:28.730 --> 00:03:31.230
Let's show them our power!

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:33.270
Juujitsu Yasai! (Complete Veggies)

00:03:33.270 --> 00:03:35.520
Ichinichibun no Yasai! (Day's Worth of Veggies)

00:03:35.520 --> 00:03:37.570
ITO EN's vegetable juices!

00:03:37.810 --> 00:03:40.190
Let's show them how we do super-dimensional soccer!

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:42.640
See you at Inazuma Eleven GO the movie!

00:03:45.360 --> 00:03:45.950
Simply...

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.070
...making it into a juice...

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:50.120
...causes it to lose...

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.460
...some of its nutrients.

00:03:52.760 --> 00:03:55.080
Enriched with all of your important nutrients.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:57.200
ITO EN's Ichinichibun no Yasai (Day's Worth of Veggies).

00:04:03.350 --> 00:04:04.950
Try it again!

00:04:04.950 --> 00:04:06.080
Double Wing!

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:10.380
Don't you realize that it's pointless?

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:14.190
Hissatsu tactics, Absolute Barrier!

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:20.060
Here it comes!

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:23.060
Raimon attempts their hissatsu tactics again!

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:33.200
Hissatsu tactics!

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:34.960
Double Wing!

00:04:37.080 --> 00:04:38.080
Left.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:38.790
Okay!

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:47.130
They're sent flying back this time too!

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:50.470
Is this Absolute Barrier impossible to break?

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:55.220
So this is the strategy he taught you?

00:04:55.220 --> 00:04:56.260
It's useless.

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:57.730
That's not true.

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:00.480
We'll break through for sure!

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.830
That's the end of the first half!

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:09.360
Raimon meets the second half at two points behind!

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:13.840
Yukimura.

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:20.190
Tell me...

00:05:20.190 --> 00:05:22.030
Why are you with Fifth Sector?

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:24.830
To win against you.

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:28.130
Don't you know what kind of soccer Fifth Sector is promoti-

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:28.980
I know!

00:05:29.330 --> 00:05:30.470
Then why?

00:05:31.230 --> 00:05:34.380
Because Fifth Sector will never betray me.

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:37.590
You betrayed me.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:41.950
After you said we'd get stronger together...

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:43.380
You've got it wrong!

00:05:43.380 --> 00:05:45.980
Fifth Sector set me up for that.

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:49.780
They had their eyes on your abilities, so they separated me from you!

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:51.780
So now you're making excuses?

00:05:52.760 --> 00:05:53.730
Yukimura...

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:59.070
I swore from my heart that I'd get back at you for what you did to me.

00:05:59.070 --> 00:06:01.920
So I'll defeat Raimon and win against you!

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:08.920
Raimon's soccer is tougher than you think it is.

00:06:09.230 --> 00:06:13.920
I'll beat down Raimon with the hissatsu technique I came up with on my own!

00:06:20.140 --> 00:06:20.980
Fubuki-san...

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:25.050
The second half will be even rougher.

00:06:25.790 --> 00:06:30.360
Coach, I'm sure that if we fight with all we've got in the second half...

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:33.910
I'm sure Hakuren will come to understand.

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:34.490
Yeah.

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:38.670
Fubuki entrusted the match to Raimon because he believes that.

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:39.710
Yes.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:44.010
The second half is finally about to start!

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:46.130
A 2-point difference...

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:47.630
It's not looking good.

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:51.960
We've got to break past Absolute Barrier... no matter what.

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:54.820
But Double Wing isn't working.

00:06:55.570 --> 00:06:57.530
Even so, we still have to try!

00:06:58.060 --> 00:06:58.620
Let's go!

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:01.220
Hey! Hold up a moment!

00:07:02.660 --> 00:07:03.560
Nishiki!

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:04.730
You made it!

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:07.100
Sorry for being late!

00:07:07.100 --> 00:07:09.690
Nishiki Ryouma has arrived at the scene!

00:07:11.650 --> 00:07:16.560
I heard you guys were stirring up a revolution and having a hard fight out here.

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:18.990
I just couldn't sit still and watch it pass by me!

00:07:19.740 --> 00:07:21.490
So this is Nishiki-senpai.

00:07:21.980 --> 00:07:25.520
Now that I'm back, you've got nothing more to worry about!

00:07:25.520 --> 00:07:28.500
You can think of it all as smooth cruising from here on!

00:07:29.010 --> 00:07:31.260
He sounds really reliable!

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.000
Yeah!

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:35.480
Raimon is changing their lineup for the second half!

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:40.760
In place of Hayami is Nishiki, who returned suddenly from playing overseas in Italy!

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:47.020
Kurama steals the ball!

00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:48.910
We're counting on you, Nishiki!

00:07:48.910 --> 00:07:50.020
Double Wing!

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:51.030
Got it!

00:07:58.110 --> 00:07:59.640
Hissatsu tactics!

00:07:59.640 --> 00:08:01.320
Absolute Barrier!

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:06.320
Hissatsu tactics!

00:08:06.320 --> 00:08:07.750
Double Wing!

00:08:17.650 --> 00:08:20.570
It really does feel different being a forward.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:22.890
Sorry, guys.

00:08:23.810 --> 00:08:28.440
To tell the truth, I converted to being a midfielder while I was overseas.

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:31.020
Converted?

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:35.510
It turns out I'm more suited to be a midfielder instead of a forward.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:37.650
That's what I was told overseas.

00:08:37.980 --> 00:08:38.980
Seriously?

00:08:39.270 --> 00:08:40.400
Seriously!

00:08:43.010 --> 00:08:44.060
No way...

00:08:46.290 --> 00:08:48.340
It'll be difficult to keep it going like this.

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:51.400
Um, Coach Endou.

00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:54.080
What is it?

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:56.650
I think I could be the one to do it.

00:08:57.030 --> 00:08:58.200
That?

00:08:58.200 --> 00:09:00.670
Would you let me try that position?

00:09:01.230 --> 00:09:01.850
What?

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:08.650
<i>So shoots go like this!</i>

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:15.260
Kidou, let's have him try it.

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:20.240
With Kageyama's kick power, he should have a fast passing speed as well.

00:09:22.740 --> 00:09:23.980
Go, Hikaru!

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:25.620
Yes, sir!

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:30.620
Raimon is changing out Amagi to appoint the first-year Kageyama as a forward!

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:35.440
This is Kageyama's first appearance. 
 What kind of plays will we see from him?

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:42.970
He's already got a feel for this ice field!

00:09:43.670 --> 00:09:44.880
Kurama-senpai!

00:09:46.730 --> 00:09:48.810
Let's do it! Double Wing!

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:49.100
Okay!

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:51.430
It's the same no matter how many times you try!

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:52.020
Do it!

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:55.400
Absolute Barrier!

00:09:58.130 --> 00:09:58.770
Kageyama!

00:09:58.770 --> 00:09:59.740
Okay!

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:10.210
Hissatsu tactics!

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:11.950
Double Wing!

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:12.660
What?

00:10:13.970 --> 00:10:15.330
Which way is the ball?

00:10:20.560 --> 00:10:21.390
What?!

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:23.050
This way!

00:10:23.510 --> 00:10:26.800
They've finally broken past Absolute Barrier!

00:10:26.800 --> 00:10:27.510
We did it!

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:31.360
What?!

00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:33.870
Goal!

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:37.190
Raimon breaks Absolute Barrier and scores one back!

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:38.720
They did it!

00:10:41.750 --> 00:10:43.510
That was awesome, Hikaru!

00:10:43.510 --> 00:10:45.050
That was so cool!

00:10:45.050 --> 00:10:47.150
I scored a goal...

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.620
I scored... a goal...

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:52.310
Yes!!

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:57.580
Yukimura, this is Raimon's soccer.

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:01.800
I can't believe they broke past Absolute Barrier.

00:11:02.200 --> 00:11:06.040
Raimon rides on the momentum and attacks Hakuren again!

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.260
Hissatsu tactics!

00:11:08.260 --> 00:11:10.010
Double Wing!

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:13.680
Absolute Barrier!

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:20.650
They've demolished the Absolute Barrier once again!

00:11:26.230 --> 00:11:27.950
Sword Saint Lancelot!

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:34.790
Lost Angel!

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:39.500
Goal!

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:42.520
Raimon ties the score!

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:43.650
Tie...

00:11:44.440 --> 00:11:46.270
What will you do now?

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:47.820
Coach Kumazaki.

00:11:47.820 --> 00:11:49.180
K-Kuroki-san!

00:11:50.120 --> 00:11:52.610
You'll lose at this rate.

00:11:52.610 --> 00:11:54.880
Damn it! I know!

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:57.010
We won't lose no matter what!

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:57.970
Oh?

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:00.420
Seki!

00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:01.400
Yeah.

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:07.070
Got it?

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:09.910
Yeah.

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:14.100
They're putting <i>him</i>  in?

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:15.790
That rough player...

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:18.150
There's going to be chaos.

00:12:18.150 --> 00:12:19.090
Guys!

00:12:19.920 --> 00:12:23.280
Obey the coach's orders! Understand?

00:12:25.350 --> 00:12:26.450
We'll just have to.

00:12:27.700 --> 00:12:30.710
Hakuren switches Itetsuki out for Seki.

00:12:30.710 --> 00:12:36.380
Honing the nickname Grizzly Bear, he's a forward who boasts of overwhelming strength!

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:41.450
I'm using a heading.

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:43.520
Send centerings to me.

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:44.520
What?

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:47.260
But you've never done heading shoots before.

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:49.360
It's the coach's orders.

00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:55.340
Stop him, Hamano!

00:12:55.340 --> 00:12:56.160
Okay!

00:12:56.390 --> 00:12:57.630
Think you can stop me?

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:02.540
Why am I sliding now of all times?!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.570
Yukimura, give it to me!

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:05.790
I know, fine!

00:13:06.520 --> 00:13:08.250
Yukimura sends up a centering!

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:10.720
I've got it!

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:16.790
Seki has lost his balance from the momentum!

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:25.680
Sangoku smashes into the goal post!

00:13:25.680 --> 00:13:27.020
He can't get up!

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:28.320
Sangoku-senpai!

00:13:32.650 --> 00:13:35.750
12.23. Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:40.560
12.23. Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:44.290
Are you all right?

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:45.740
I'm fine.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:49.180
He did that play on purpose.

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:51.410
Yeah, that's what I think too.

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:53.180
He plays dirty.

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:54.550
Unforgivable. {this squeak}

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:56.740
So this is Hakuren now...

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:02.070
Sangoku, you're on bench.

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:04.240
I'm fine, I can still play!

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:06.330
Not in that condition.

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:09.480
But we don't have any other goalkeepers.

00:14:10.040 --> 00:14:13.720
That's right. You're the only goalkeeper for Raimon.

00:14:14.430 --> 00:14:15.740
Now and for the future.

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:16.710
Then...

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:20.680
We have to keep fighting until we get the Holy Road championship.

00:14:20.680 --> 00:14:24.600
Don't push yourself too hard to protect the goal at this point.

00:14:26.170 --> 00:14:27.220
Got it?

00:14:28.560 --> 00:14:29.610
Yes, sir.

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:32.080
Tenma, put on the goalkeeper uniform.

00:14:33.270 --> 00:14:35.640
You're the only other here experienced as a goalkeeper.

00:14:35.640 --> 00:14:36.940
It's up to you.

00:14:36.940 --> 00:14:37.300
Yes, sir.

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:39.930
You can do it, Tenma! Good luck!

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:44.430
Yeah. We'll do all we can to defend, too.

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:46.440
Okay!

00:14:46.750 --> 00:14:49.020
Okay, good work.

00:14:49.020 --> 00:14:49.780
Yeah.

00:14:49.780 --> 00:14:51.150
What was so good about that?

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:53.150
You could've dodged him.

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:56.810
It was an order to hurt them.

00:14:56.810 --> 00:14:57.280
What?

00:14:58.800 --> 00:15:01.790
<i>This</i>  is how you play the Fifth's soccer.

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:08.390
Fifth Sector does things like <i>that</i>  too?

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:12.980
Raimon switches out the injured Sangoku for Kurumada.

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:15.970
And Matsukaze has been put into the goalkeeper's position!

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:19.090
It'll be okay. It'll work out somehow.

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:20.430
Here it comes!

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:25.780
It doesn't matter how it looks.

00:15:25.780 --> 00:15:28.200
Just don't let them get past the goal line.

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:29.600
Don't lose when it comes to spirit!

00:15:31.680 --> 00:15:33.020
Seki steals the ball!

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:37.010
The Mist!

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:41.700
You're in the way!

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:44.910
You're not getting through!

00:15:46.940 --> 00:15:49.130
We'll protect Raimon's goal!

00:15:49.400 --> 00:15:50.560
No freaking way!

00:15:50.560 --> 00:15:51.750
I'll beat you to a pulp!

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:56.420
Hakuren is on the offense again!

00:15:56.900 --> 00:15:58.180
I won't let you through!

00:16:01.080 --> 00:16:02.000
What?

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:03.130
I'll take that!

00:16:03.130 --> 00:16:04.060
Not happening!

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:09.690
Kageyama and Nishiki return to the defense!

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:12.650
Yes! They defended it!

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:14.230
They're doing great!

00:16:15.010 --> 00:16:16.610
Got a cool take.

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:19.870
The Raimon Eleven protect with all their might!

00:16:19.870 --> 00:16:22.720
They're holding up for Matsukaze who's not used to his position!

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:32.630
We'll protect it, no matter what!

00:16:33.020 --> 00:16:35.340
Damn it, he's just an amateur keeper...

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:40.050
Yukimura, realize what Raimon's soccer is.

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:42.080
Give me the ball!

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:45.420
Wait, we need to calm down and think this through!

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:47.560
Look at the bench.

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:49.810
Give Seki the ball!

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:53.020
That's all you need to do!

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:55.770
I won't let you score!

00:16:57.770 --> 00:16:59.960
Yukimura dives for the open ball!

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:03.320
Matsukaze makes a clean catch!

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.280
Shinsuke, you okay?

00:17:08.290 --> 00:17:09.200
I'm fine!

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:15.960
All right!

00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:25.690
How's that?

00:17:26.430 --> 00:17:27.510
These guys...

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:34.350
I got it!

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:38.680
You guys look lame.

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:41.270
Don't laugh!

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:45.980
<i>We're</i>  the ones who can't <i>score</i>  against those lame-looking guys.

00:17:45.980 --> 00:17:47.500
What'd you say?!

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:57.940
Tenma!

00:17:57.940 --> 00:18:00.430
There's God's Baton!

00:18:00.430 --> 00:18:01.320
Okay!

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:05.800
Hakuren's formation is suddenly left open with vulnerable gaps!

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:06.970
Kageyama!

00:18:06.970 --> 00:18:07.980
Okay!

00:18:12.530 --> 00:18:13.520
Nishiki!

00:18:14.020 --> 00:18:15.020
Nishiki-senpai!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:17.880
I won't let this chance slip by!

00:18:17.880 --> 00:18:18.730
Damn it!

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:25.240
Acrobat Keep!

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:28.030
That was some impressive keep power!

00:18:30.370 --> 00:18:31.320
What?!

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:34.550
Instrumentalist Maestro!

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:44.460
Harmonics!

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:50.110
Goal!

00:18:50.110 --> 00:18:52.020
Raimon finally turns the score around!

00:18:52.580 --> 00:18:54.850
This is... Raimon?

00:18:57.400 --> 00:19:01.630
I chose Fifth Sector's soccer in order to win against you.

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:06.360
But that was a wrong choice.

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:11.700
Here we go!

00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:13.330
We'll reverse the score no matter what!

00:19:13.330 --> 00:19:14.560
Yeah!

00:19:15.660 --> 00:19:16.880
What're you doing?

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:18.710
Give Seki the ball!

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:19.880
Over here!

00:19:25.780 --> 00:19:28.090
Guys, do what you're told to do!

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:29.770
It's pointless.

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:32.560
None of us are obeying Fifth Sector anymore.

00:19:33.840 --> 00:19:34.970
Those guys...!

00:19:37.220 --> 00:19:39.020
Time is running out!

00:19:39.020 --> 00:19:44.150
Will Raimon come out victorious, or will Hakuren catch up and bring the game to extra time?

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:45.570
Rumoi!

00:19:45.570 --> 00:19:46.450
Yeah!

00:19:47.090 --> 00:19:48.750
Hakuren connects their passes!

00:19:48.750 --> 00:19:49.780
I won't let you through!

00:19:50.510 --> 00:19:51.240
Kitaki!

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:52.250
Yeah!

00:19:52.870 --> 00:19:54.160
You won't get past me!

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:55.120
Yukimura!

00:19:56.970 --> 00:19:59.130
Yukimura takes the pass!

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:02.710
I'm taking the goal this time!

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:05.730
You can do it, Yukimura!

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:07.820
Senpai...

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:19.560
Abounding Snowfall Saya!

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:21.560
I'll get this in no matter what!

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:25.010
Icicle Road!

00:20:29.110 --> 00:20:31.820
Hunter's Net!

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:36.070
We'll make it through somehow!

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:48.380
Demon God Pegasus!

00:20:56.160 --> 00:20:56.970
What?

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:03.530
He kicked it back with his Avatar...

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:08.020
That's the end of the match!

00:21:08.020 --> 00:21:10.420
Raimon wins!

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:13.340
Yes!!

00:21:13.850 --> 00:21:15.320
We did it!

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.400
Fubuki-senpai...

00:21:28.150 --> 00:21:31.130
So this is the soccer you were talking about.

00:21:32.320 --> 00:21:33.990
What crazy people...

00:21:37.530 --> 00:21:41.940
Let's play soccer together again, Yukimura.

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:43.140
Fubuki-senpai!

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:47.600
I'm glad for Fubuki.

00:21:47.600 --> 00:21:48.120
Yeah.

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:54.120
Hakuren understood their passionate soccer.

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:02.050
What did you want to talk about?

00:22:09.830 --> 00:22:10.600
What?

00:22:12.940 --> 00:22:15.670
What makes you call me out here?

00:22:16.490 --> 00:22:17.620
I've got a favor.

00:22:18.090 --> 00:22:18.890
Favor?

00:22:19.820 --> 00:22:22.390
I'm leaving my position as Raimon's coach.

00:22:24.470 --> 00:22:25.650
Kidou.

00:22:25.650 --> 00:22:28.230
Take up the position in my place.

00:22:28.230 --> 00:22:30.360
What's the meaning of this, Endou?!

00:22:30.580 --> 00:22:36.310
Fifth Sector's true goal might not just be the management of soccer.

00:22:36.990 --> 00:22:38.120
What?

00:22:38.530 --> 00:22:43.240
It's not fully clear yet, so I want to investigate.

00:22:44.150 --> 00:22:47.380
Right now, you're the only one I can entrust Raimon to.

00:22:48.430 --> 00:22:50.250
Please, Kidou.

00:22:51.150 --> 00:22:52.080
You...

00:24:23.740 --> 00:24:24.930
This can't be happening!

00:24:24.930 --> 00:24:27.810
Coach Endou left us just like that?

00:24:27.810 --> 00:24:30.350
And Coach Kidou starts his command...

00:24:30.350 --> 00:24:34.530
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 Coach Kidou's Apprehension

00:24:34.530 --> 00:24:36.280
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:24:45.110 --> 00:24:47.790
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:24:52.890 --> 00:24:56.550
It doesn't matter how it looks. 
 Don't lose when it comes to spirit!

00:24:56.550 --> 00:24:57.320
That's all!
